1. Grant
Subject to full compliance with this license, any individual, team, or
commercial organization may, free of charge and perpetually: (a) use the
Software, including in commercial environments; (b) copy and distribute
the Software; (c) modify the Software and distribute modified versions.

2. Attribution
(a) This license text and the copyright notice above must be retained in
all distributions; (b) modified versions must be prominently marked as
"modified from T-Translate, not the original", with a link to
https://github.com/Tianao0110/T-Translate ; (c) claiming the Software or
a modified version as one's own original work, or removing/altering the
author attribution, is prohibited.

3. No Selling (core term)
The Software, and any modified or derivative version containing any of
its code, must remain free of charge as a whole — including features
newly added by the modifier. Turning it into a paid offering, directly
or indirectly, is prohibited, including but not limited to: selling the
software or charging for downloads; in-app purchases, subscriptions, or
pay-to-unlock features under any name; bundling it behind paid file
hosting, paid tutorials, or paid communities; preinstall-for-a-fee or
rebranded resale ("optimized/enhanced/pro" editions).
Note: to charge for innovations built on this Software, seek a commercial
license under Section 9, or implement the innovation as standalone
software containing none of this Software's code.

4. Permitted commercial activities
Not restricted by Section 3: (a) using the Software in commercial
environments; (b) monetized tutorials/reviews/videos about the Software,
provided the Software itself remains freely available; (c) paid technical
services (deployment, maintenance, custom development labor); (d)
voluntary donations, provided no feature is gated behind them.

5. Contributions
Any contribution submitted to this project is deemed licensed under this
license by its contributor.

6. Third-party components
Third-party open-source components remain under their own licenses (see
NOTICE) and are not covered by this license.

7. Disclaimer
THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS
OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF
MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.
IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE SOFTWARE.
Costs and compliance obligations of third-party API services configured
by the user are the user's own responsibility.

8. Termination
Any violation of this license automatically terminates all rights
granted herein.

9. Commercial licensing
For rights beyond this license (including commercial sale), contact the
author via https://github.com/Tianao0110/T-Translate .
